@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Custom gfx1100 IQ4_XS Kernels -- Phase 6
+
+Source: kernels/matmul_iq4xs/
+
+- gemv_iq4xs.cuh: 128-bit aligned vector loads, zero-LDS cooperative 8-thread/row dequant, shared reduction (decode M=1).
+- gemm_iq4xs.cuh: TILE_M=16 reuse + RDNA3 WMMA hardware matrix cores (prefill M>=16).
+
+Controlled by CMake option GGML_CUDA_ENABLE_CUSTOM_GFX1100 (default OFF).
+When OFF, compiles clean and behaves bit-identically to upstream stock.
